      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Onye mmebi iwu ahụ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ihe banyere ọbịbịa Onyenwe anyị Jisọs Kraịst, na nzukọ anyị na ya ga-ezukọta, anyị na-adụsị unu ọdụ ike ụmụnna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka unu ghara ịma jijiji maọbụ ịtụ egwu nʼuche unu nʼihi amụma, maọbụ okwu maọbụ akwụkwọ ozi e dere dị ka o sitere nʼaka anyị, nke na-asị nʼụbọchị Onyenwe anyị eruola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu ekwela ka onye ọbụla duhie unu nʼụzọ ọbụla, nʼihi na ụbọchị ahụ agaghị abịa tutu ruo mgbe oke inupu isi ga-adị, na mgbe a ga-ekpughe onye mmebi iwu ahụ nke a kara akara ịla nʼiyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye mmebi iwu ahụ ga-ebuli onwe ya elu megide ihe niile a na-akpọ chi maọbụ nke a na-efe ofufe, nke ga-eme ka o dozie onwe ya nʼụlọnsọ Chineke, na-ekwupụta na ya bụ Chineke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu echetaghị ihe m gwara unu nʼoge mụ na unu nọ banyere ya?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ugbu a, unu maara na o nwere onye na-egbochi ya ka ọ hapụ ịpụta ihe. Nʼihi na mgbe ọ ga-apụta bụ mgbe oge ya ruru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ọrụ nzuzo nke mmebi iwu ebidolarị ugbu a, ma onye ahụ na-egbochi ya ịbabiga ụba oke ga-anọgide na-eme otu a tutu ruo mgbe oge e wezugara ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe ahụ, a ga-eme ka onye mmebi iwu ahụ pụta ìhè, bụ onye Onyenwe anyị Jisọs ga-eji ume ọ ga-esi nʼọnụ ya kupụta laa nʼiyi, ma mee ka ọ ghara ịdịkwa ọzọ site nʼọbịbịa ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ọbịbịa onye mmebi iwu ahụ ga-abụ dị ka ọrụ ekwensu si dị, site nʼike ịrụ ọrụ ebube aghụghọ na ihe ịrịbama dị iche iche, na ọrụ ịtụnanya aghụghọ dị iche iche nke ụgha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya na ụdị ọrụ ọjọọ dị iche iche nke ọ ga-eji duhie ndị ahụ na-ala nʼiyi. Ha ga-ala nʼiyi nʼihi na ha jụrụ ịhụ eziokwu nʼanya ma nwee nzọpụta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi nke a, Chineke ga-ahapụ ha ka e duhie ha, ka ha jiri obi ha niile nabata okwu ụgha ndị a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe nke a pụtara bụ na ndị niile na-ekweghị nʼeziokwu ahụ ma nwee mmasị nʼajọ omume ka a ga-ama ikpe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Guzoro chịm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyị kwesiri inye Chineke ekele mgbe niile nʼihi unu ụmụnna ndị Onyenwe anyị hụrụ nʼanya. Nʼihi na Chineke esitelarị na mmalite họpụta unu ka unu bụrụ ndị a zọpụtara site nʼọrụ ido nsọ nke Mmụọ Nsọ na site nʼokwukwe unu nʼeziokwu ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼihi nke a, ọ kpọrọ unu site nʼoziọma anyị ka unu nweta otuto nke Onyenwe anyị Jisọs Kraịst.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere, ụmụnna, nọgidenụ nʼozizi ahụ anyị mere ka unu mụta site nʼozizi anyị ziri unu, maọbụ na akwụkwọ anyị deere unu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Onyenwe anyị Jisọs Kraịst nʼonwe ya, na Chineke Nna anyị, onye hụrụ anyị nʼanya, site nʼamara ya nye anyị agbamume dị ebighị ebi na ezi olileanya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gbaa obi unu ume, ma mee ka unu guzosie ike nʼịrụ ọrụ na ikwukwa ihe niile dị mma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
